// Title: PowerShell as a Service in Registry
// Rule ID: 4a5f5a5e-ac01-474b-9b4e-d61298c9df1d
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1569.002
// Category: registry_set
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_powershell_as_service.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
